<https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/ContingentConvertible> linkml:description "Specifies a debt security that can be converted into equity if a pre-defined trigger event occurs." .

<https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/Contract> linkml:description "Denotes financial contracts, such as listed futures and options." .

<https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/ContractTermsAmendment> linkml:description "The intent is to amend the terms of the contract through renegotiation." .

<https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/ContractualParty> linkml:description "A party to a contractual document.  If the intended usage relates to the context of the trade lifecycle, more specific annotations have been defined which might be more appropriate." ;
