<https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/ContractualProduct> linkml:description "Denotes a Contractual Product as defined in the CDM.  This unit type would be used when the price applies to the whole product, for example, in the case of a premium expressed as a cash amount." .

<https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/Convertible> linkml:description "Specifies a debt instrument that can be converted into common shares." .

<https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/ConvertiblePreference> linkml:description "Identifies an Equity of Convertible Preference, a stock which can be converted into a predetermined number of common shares and holds priority to receive capital return in event of issuer liquidation." .

<https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/Corporate> linkml:description "Specifies corporate bodies including Banks." .

<https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/Correct> linkml:description "A correction of a prior instance of the transaction event. The eventIdentifier has an associated version greater than 1." .

<https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/CostsApportioned> linkml:description "Costs apportioned for Substitution." .

<https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/CounterPartyAffiliate> linkml:description "Organization officially attached to the counterparty. e.g. partner, branch, subsidiary." ;
    linkml:meaning "http://www.fpml.org/coding-scheme/party-role-4-0#CounterPartyAffiliate"^^xsd:anyURI .

<https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/CounterPartyUltimateParent> linkml:description "The topmost entity or organization, within the corporate hierarchy, responsible for the reporting party." ;
    linkml:meaning "http://www.fpml.org/coding-scheme/party-role-4-0#CounterPartyUltimateParent"^^xsd:anyURI .

<https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/CountryCode> linkml:description "The ISO 3166 Country Code." .

