<https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/PHP_TELERATE_15439_PHP03> skos:altLabel "PHP.TELERATE.15439/PHP03" ;
    linkml:description "The Spot Rate for a Rate Calculation Date will be the Philippine Peso/U.S. Dollar tom rate (mid market), expressed as the amount of Philippine Pesos per one U.S. Dollar, for settlement in one Business Day which appears on the Telerate Page 15439 at approximately 11:00 a.m., Manila time, on that Rate Calculation Date." .

<https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/PHP_TELERATE_2920_PHP02> skos:altLabel "PHP.TELERATE.2920/PHP02" ;
