    linkml:description "Per 2021 ISDA Interest Rate Derivatives Definitions Floating Rate Matrix, as amended through the date on which parties enter into the relevant transaction." .

<https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/RUB_MICEXFRX_RUB01> skos:altLabel "RUB.MICEXFRX/RUB01" ;
    linkml:description "The Spot Rate for a Rate Calculation Date will be the Russian Ruble/U.S. Dollar Specified Rate, expressed as the amount of Russian Rubies per one U.S. Dollar, for settlement on the same day reported by the Moscow Interbank Currency Exchange which appears on the Reuters Screen MICEXFRX Page as of 10:30 a.m., Moscow time, on that Rate Calculation Date." .

<https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/RUB_MMVB_RUB02> skos:altLabel "RUB.MMVB/RUB02" ;
