<https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/RegionalGovernment> linkml:description "Specifies Regional Governments including states within countries, local authorities and municipalities." .

<https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/RelatedExchange> linkml:description "Related Exchange." .

<https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/RelatedMasterAgreement> linkml:description "As agreed in the ISDA Master Agreement" .

<https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/Relisting> linkml:description "Corporate action triggered by the relisting of a security from the original stock exchange to another exchange." .

<https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/RemainingMaturity> linkml:description "Denotes a period from now until maturity date." .

<https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/Replace> linkml:description "When the quantity should be replaced by the specified amount." .

<https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/ReplacementValueCalculationAgentDetermination> linkml:description "An ISDA defined cash settlement method used for the determination of the applicable cash settlement amount. The method is defined in the 2021 ISDA Definitions, Section 18.2.5" .

<https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/ReplacementValueFirmQuotations> linkml:description "An ISDA defined cash settlement method used for the determination of the applicable cash settlement amount. The method is defined in the 2021 ISDA Definitions, Section 18.2.4." .

<https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/Repo> linkml:description "In the case of a repurchase transaction, an immediate and equal income payment (often call a manufactured payment) is made by the buyer to the seller." .

<https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/RepoDurationEnum> skos:inScheme "https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/cdm_product_template"^^xsd:anyURI ;
    linkml:definition_uri "https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/RepoDurationEnum"^^xsd:anyURI ;
    linkml:description "A duration code for a Repo (or Securities Lending) transaction. There are many business and market rules that are derived from the duration of the transaction." ;
    linkml:permissible_values <https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/Overnight>,
        <https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/Term> .

<https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/ReportingParty> linkml:description "The party with the regulatory responsibility to report this trade." ;
