<https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/TZS> linkml:description "Tanzanian Shilling" .

<https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/Takeover> linkml:description "Corporate action triggered by a takeover. A takeover is the purchase of onecompany (the target) by another (the acquirer, or bidder). The value maps to the ISO code (TEND) but is finer grained than TEND which emcompasses Tender/Acquisition/Takeover/Purchase Offer/Buyback. ISO defines the TEND code as an offer made to shareholders, normally by a third party, requesting them to sell (tender) or exchange their equities." .

<https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/Tapis> linkml:description "Applies to Oil Product Type Oil." ;
    linkml:meaning "http://www.fpml.org/coding-scheme/commodity-oil-product-grade-1-0#Tapis"^^xsd:anyURI .

<https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/TaxEvent> linkml:description "Specifies an event where a party experiences changes in tax laws incurring further tax liability." .

<https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/TaxEventUponMerger> linkml:description "Specifies an event where a party incurs tax liability due to a merger." .

<https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/TermRate> skos:altLabel "Term Rate" ;
    linkml:description "A rate specified over a given term, such as a libor-type rate." .

<https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/TermSheet> linkml:description "Document describing the economic characteristics of a transaction." ;
    linkml:meaning "http://www.fpml.org/coding-scheme/resource-type-1-1#TermSheet"^^xsd:anyURI .

<https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/Termination> linkml:description "A transfer associated with a termination lifecycle event." .

<https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/TerminationDate> linkml:description "Termination date of the swap." .

<https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/TerminationEvent> linkml:description "A Termination Event." .

<https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/TerminationEventAllAffectedTransactions> skos:altLabel "A Termination Event in respect of which all Transactions are Affected Transactions" ;
    linkml:description "A Termination Event in respect of which all Transactions are Affected Transactions." .

<https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/TheFXCommittee> linkml:description "The Foreign Exchange Committee" .

<https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/ThirdDay> skos:altLabel "Third Local Business Day" ;
    linkml:description "The securities collateral should be transferred on the third local business day." .

<https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/ThirdPartyCustodian> linkml:description "A third-party providing custody, settlement, segregation and reporting services." .

<https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/Thirdlast> skos:altLabel "3rd Last" ;
    linkml:description "Specific Valuation date frequency." .

<https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/Thunder_Horse> skos:altLabel "Thunder-Horse" ;
    linkml:description "Applies to Oil Product Type Oil." .

<https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/TimesAdjusted> linkml:description "Times adjusted." .

<https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/Total> linkml:description "Total return, i.e. including dividend and price components." .

<https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/TradeDate> linkml:description "Trade date of the swap" .

<https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/TradeRepository> linkml:description "An organization that maintains records of the trade for regulatory reporting purposes." ;
    linkml:meaning "http://www.fpml.org/coding-scheme/party-role-4-0#TradeRepository"^^xsd:anyURI .

<https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/TradeSource> linkml:description "The organization that originally supplied the record of the trade. In the context of regulatory reporting, it is the submitter of the trade record to a regulator or TR." ;
    linkml:meaning "http://www.fpml.org/coding-scheme/party-role-4-0#TradeSource"^^xsd:anyURI .

<https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/TradedSpread> linkml:description "When quotation style is 'TradedSpread', the marketFixedRate element of the Credit Default Swap feeLeg should be populated" .

<https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/Trader> linkml:description "The person who executed the trade." .

<https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/TradingManager> linkml:description "The entity responsible for managing the assets/investments of this party.  Synonym:  Asset Manager, Investment Manager, Trading Advisory." ;
    linkml:meaning "http://www.fpml.org/coding-scheme/party-role-4-0#TradingManager"^^xsd:anyURI .

<https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/TradingPartner> linkml:description "An entity with which this party trades from time to time, ie. with which it acts as a counterparty on some transactions.   This role is used for static reference data, not individual transactions." ;
    linkml:meaning "http://www.fpml.org/coding-scheme/party-role-4-0#TradingPartner"^^xsd:anyURI .

<https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/TranchedCreditRisk> linkml:description "Indicates tranched credit risk, including securitizations." .

<https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/TransferIfDeliveryAmountBelowMTA> linkml:description "Interest amount is not transferred if transfer would create or increase a delivery amount. (This is the 'Standard' provision). However, interest Amount will be transferred if Delivery Amount is below Minimum Transfer Amount." .

<https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/Transfer_or_Adjust> linkml:description " Transfer the interest if it meets certain criteria, or otherwise adjust the collateral balance to reflect the interest amount  " .

<https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/TripartyAgent> linkml:description "A third party entity that acts as an intermediary and provides automated clearing, settlement, allocation, valuation and reporting services." .

<https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/Two> linkml:description "No rating is available for the Party for any two of the stated Rating Agencies." .

<https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/UA> linkml:description "Ukraine" .

<https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/UAH> linkml:description "Hryvnia" .

<https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/UAH_EMTA_INDICATIVE_SURVEY_RATE_UAH03> skos:altLabel "UAH.EMTA.INDICATIVE.SURVEY.RATE/UAH03" ;
    linkml:description "The Spot Rate for a Rate Calculation Date will be the Ukrainian Hryvnia/U.S. Dollar Specified Rate for U.S. Dollars, expressed as the amount of Ukrainian Hryvnia per one U.S. Dollar, for settlement on the same Business Day, as published on EMTA's website (www.emta.org) at approximately 2:00 p.m., Kiev time, or as soon thereafter as practicable, on that Rate Calculation Date. The Spot Rate shall be calculated by EMTA (or a service provider EMTA may select in its sole discretion) pursuant to the EMTA UAH Indicative Survey Methodology (which means a methodology, dated as of March 16, 2009, as amended from time to time, for a centralized industry-wide survey of financial institutions that are active participants in the Ukrainian Hryvnia / U.S. Dollar markets for the purpose of determining the EMTA UAH Indicative Survey Rate)." .

<https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/UAH_EMTA_INDUSTRY_SURVEY_RATE_UAH02> skos:altLabel "UAH.EMTA.INDUSTRY.SURVEY.RATE/UAH02" ;
    linkml:description "The Spot Rate for a Rate Calculation Date will be the Ukrainian Hryvnia/U.S. Dollar Specified Rate for U.S. Dollars expressed as the amount of Ukrainian Hryvnia per one U.S. Dollar, for settlement on the same Business Day calculated by Thomson Reuters pursuant to the EMTA UAH Industry Survey Methodology, which rate appears on EMTA's website (www.emta.org) and on Thomson Reuters Page EMTAUAHFIX at approximately 11:30 am, Kiev time, on that Rate Calculation Date. The 'EMTA UAH Industry Survey Methodology' as used herein means the methodology dated as of March 16, 2009, for a centralized industry wide survey of financial institutions in the Ukrainian Hryvnia/U.S. Dollar spot market for the purposes of determining the EMTA UAH Industry Survey Rate." .

<https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/UAH_GFI_UAH01> skos:altLabel "UAH.GFI/UAH01" ;
    linkml:description "The Spot Rate for a Rate Calculation Date will be the Ukrainian Hryvnia/U.S. Dollar spot rate, expressed as the amount of Ukrainian Hryvnia per one U.S. Dollar, for settlement on the same Business Day reported by GFI Brokers on Thomson Reuters Page GFIU by 9:30 am, London time, on that Rate Calculation Date." .

