<https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/Unweighted> linkml:description "The arithmetic mean of the relevant rates for each reset date." .

<https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/UnwindExDiv> linkml:description "Pays a fraction of the total on each Unwind Trade Settlement Date which occurs after the Dividend Ex Date, until trade is fully unwound." .

<https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/UnwindOrEquityExDiv> linkml:description "Pays a fraction of the Dividend Amount on each Unwind Trade Settlement Date which occurs after the Dividend Ex Date, until position is fully unwound OR on the next Equity Pay Date after the Dividend Pay Date. This will be whichever date comes first or a combination of both." .

<https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/UnwindOrEquityPaid> linkml:description "Pays a fraction of the Dividend Amount on each Unwind Trade Settlement Date which occurs after the Dividend Pay Date, until position is fully unwound OR on the next Equity Pay Date after the Dividend Pay Date. This will be whichever date comes first or a combination of both." .

<https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/UnwindOrInterestExDiv> linkml:description "Pays a fraction of the Dividend Amount on each Unwind Trade Settlement Date which occurs after the Dividend Ex Date, until position is fully unwound OR on the next Interest Pay Date after the Dividend Ex Date. This will be whichever date comes first or a combination of both." .

<https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/UnwindOrInterestPaid> linkml:description "Pays a fraction of the Dividend Amount on each Unwind Trade Settlement Date which occurs after the Dividend Pay Date, until position is fully unwound OR on the next Interest Pay Date after the Dividend Pay Date. This will be whichever date comes first or a combination of both." .

<https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/UnwindPaid> linkml:description "Pays a fraction of the total on each Unwind Trade Settlement Date which occurs after the Dividend Pay Date, until trade is fully unwound." .

<https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/Upfront> linkml:description "An upfront transfer associated to the swap to adjust for a difference between the swap price and the current market price." .

