<https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/ValuePerDay> linkml:description "Denotes a value (expressed in currency units) for a one day change in a valuation date, which is typically used for expressing sensitivity to the passage of time, also known as theta risk, or carry, or other names." .

