    linkml:description "Defines the different methods to specify a valuation date, as used for cash settlement. The Single / Multiple ValuationDate is used for the determination of recovery in a credit event, the RelativeDateOffset is used for cash-settled option, and FxFixingDate is used for cross-currency settlement." ;
    linkml:domain <https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/CashSettlementTerms> ;
    linkml:domain_of <https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/CashSettlementTerms> ;
