<https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/Up> linkml:description "A fractional number will be rounded up to the specified number of decimal places (the precision). For example, 5.21 and 5.25 rounded up to 1 decimal place are 5.3 and 5.3 respectively.",
