    linkml:description "Represents the European Master Confirmation value of 'All Dividends' which, when applicable, signifies that, for a given Ex-Date, the daily observed Share Price for that day is adjusted (reduced) by the cash dividend and/or the cash value of any non cash dividend per Share (including Extraordinary Dividends) declared by the Issuer. All Dividends in accordance with the ISDA 2002 Equity Derivatives Definitions." ;
    linkml:domain_of <https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/DividendApplicability> ;
    linkml:owner <https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/DividendApplicability> ;
