    linkml:definition_uri "https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/intent"^^xsd:anyURI ;
    linkml:description "The intent attribute is meant to be specified when the event qualification cannot be programmatically inferred from the event features. As a result it is only associated with those primitives that can give way to such ambiguity, the quantityChange being one of those." ;
