    linkml:definition_uri "https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/referenceEntity"^^xsd:anyURI ;
    linkml:description "The corporate or sovereign entity which is subject to the swap transaction and any successor that assumes all or substantially all of its contractual and other obligations. Reference Entities cannot be senior or subordinated. It is the obligations of the Reference Entities that can be senior or subordinated. ISDA 2014 Credit definitions article II section 2.1: `Reference Entity` means the entity specified as such in the related Confirmation." ;
    linkml:domain_of <https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/ReferenceInformation>,
