    linkml:definition_uri "https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/amountUtilized"^^xsd:anyURI ;
    linkml:description "The limit utilised by all the cleared trades for the limit level and limit type. While the attribute is of type integer in FpML and the CME schema, it has been specified to be of type number in the CDM to take into consideration java size limits as well as for consistency purposes with the way most monetary amounts are expressed." ;
