        <https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/BillingRecordInstruction>,
        <https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/NonDeliverableSubstitute>,
        <https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/SettlementBase> ;
