    skos:note "Rosetta condition: RestrictingCreditNotation — (scale is absent and debt is absent and outlook is absent and creditWatch is absent) and (agency exists and notation exists)" ;
    linkml:definition_uri "https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/DirectionRating"^^xsd:anyURI ;
    linkml:description "A logical container to hold a defined set of related data. In this case the collation of Ratings Agency, Rating value and an associated direction." ;
