    linkml:slots <https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/MultipleCreditNotations_creditNotation>,
        <https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/condition>,
        <https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/mismatchResolution>,
        <https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/referenceAgency> .

