    linkml:slots <https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/AdditionalRightsEvent_isApplicable>,
        <https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/AdditionalRightsEvent_qualification> .

<https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/Address> a linkml:ClassDefinition ;
