        <https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/aggregation>,
        <https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/definitionOfMarketValueNonStandard>,
        <https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/failureToDevliverIndemnityApplies>,
        <https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/nettingObligationsApply>,
        <https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/standardDefinitionOfMarketValueUsed> .

