        <https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/fixedPrice>,
        <https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/principalPayment> .

<https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/FloatingAmountCalculationDetails> a linkml:ClassDefinition ;
