        <https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/CreditSupportAgreementLegacyElections_securityInterestForObligations>,
        <https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/additionalRepresentations>,
        <https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/addressesForTransfer>,
        <https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/baseAndEligibleCurrency>,
        <https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/conditionsPrecedent>,
        <https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/demandsAndNotices>,
        <https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/disputeResolution>,
        <https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/distributionAndInterestPayment>,
        <https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/exchangeDate>,
        <https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/finalReturns>,
        <https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/holdingAndUsingPostedCollateral>,
        <https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/masterAgreementDatedAsOfDate>,
        <https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/otherEligibleAndPostedSupport>,
