        <https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/AvailableInventoryRecord_comment>,
        <https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/AvailableInventoryRecord_partyRole>,
        <https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/AvailableInventoryRecord_quantity>,
