        <https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/FloatingRateIndexCalculationDefaults_category>,
        <https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/FloatingRateIndexCalculationDefaults_dayCountFraction>,
        <https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/FloatingRateIndexCalculationDefaults_method>,
        <https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/fixing>,
